 "title": "Beta(2, 2) prior and Beta(9, 5) posterior",
 "caption": "Seven heads and three tails add 7 to α and 3 to β: Beta(2, 2) becomes Beta(9, 5), narrower and shifted right, with mean 9/14 ≈ 0.643.",
