 "description": [
  "The prior 6x(1 − x) is symmetric about 0.5.",
  "After 7 heads and 3 tails the density is proportional to x⁸(1 − x)⁴, which is Beta(9, 5).",
  "Its peak is at 8/12 = 2/3 and its mean 9/14."
 ],
